/// Report icon PNGs, sourced from the icon set the user supplied
/// ("pc-iconen-2", 90-icon glossy dark-tile style) and picked to
/// replace the earlier hand-drawn SVG glyphs in ReportService -- see
/// that class's doc comment for the full history. Stored here as
/// plain base64 (no "data:" prefix) so both renderers can use the
/// same bytes: the HTML builder wraps a string in a
/// "data:image/png;base64,..." URI, the PDF builder base64-decodes
/// it straight into a pw.MemoryImage.
///
/// Kept in its own file (rather than inline in report_service.dart)
/// purely so that already-large file does not balloon further --
/// this is pure data, nothing to read or maintain here besides the
/// key names below.
